title: BreathingThought
---
{$PlayerName}: ... I'm too tired, I need to take a break.
===

title: WindowNPCChat
---
Stranger: Hey! Sorry to bother you — my car broke down back there.
Stranger: Any chance of a lift?
-> {$PlayerName}: Let me call the police, they can help.
    <<CallPolice>>
-> {$PlayerName}: Sorry, I can't. Hope you find help.
    <<DriveOff>>
===

title: PoliceCall
---
Officer: Highgate police, what's your emergency?
{$PlayerName}: Hi, I'm on the country road — someone's car has broken down.
Officer: Thank you for calling. We'll send someone to your location.
Officer: One more thing — we've had reports of a violent individual in that area tonight. Please stay safe.
===

title: AfterPoliceCall
---
-> {$PlayerName}: Help is coming. They mentioned reports of someone dangerous nearby...
    Stranger: ...Right. Thanks for letting me know.
-> {$PlayerName}: Someone's on their way.
    Stranger: Cheers. I appreciate it.
<<NpcWalksAway>>
===